      "description": "کارت پیشنهاد با why و آکورد.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><header><span>پیشنهاد اول</span><button class=\"ds-chip\">مقایسه</button></header><h3>خمره</h3><p class=\"ds-muted\">لطافه</p><div class=\"ds-accord\"></div><div class=\"ds-why\"><small>چرا این عطر؟</small><p>خرما، دارچین و وانیل گرم است.</p></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{background:#fbfcfb;border:1px solid #d5dbd7;border-radius:16px;padding:14px;color:#1c211f;font-family:Vazirmatn,Tahoma,sans-serif}.ds-card header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:12px;color:#4e5854;margin-bottom:10px}.ds-card h3{margin:0;font:600 1.05rem/1.4 Vazirmatn,Tahoma,sans-serif}.ds-muted{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#4e5854}.ds-accord{margin-top:12px;height:8px;border-radius:9999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8C4A32 34%,#C4A574 28%,#A65D3F 22%,#B7A99A 16%)}.ds-why{margin-top:14px;background:#e7ebe8;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px}.ds-why small{display:block;font:600 12px/1 Vazirmatn,Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#4e5854}.ds-why p{margin:6px 0 0;font:400 15px/1.75 Vazirmatn,Tahoma,sans-serif}"
